{"suttaId":"thi-ap27","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[9215,9423],"vripara":"244"},"segments":{"thi-ap27:0.3":"Bhaddakāpilānītherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap27:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū [sabbadhammesu cakkhumā (sī. pī.)];","thi-ap27:1.3":"Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji nāyako.","thi-ap27:2.1":"“Tadāhu haṃsavatiyaṃ, videho nāma nāmato [nāmako (syā. pī.)];","thi-ap27:2.3":"Seṭṭhī pahūtaratano, tassa jāyā ahosahaṃ.","thi-ap27:3.1":"“Kadāci so narādiccaṃ, upecca saparijjano;","thi-ap27:3.3":"Dhammamassosi buddhassa, sabbadukkhabhayappahaṃ [dukkhakkhayāvahaṃ (syā.)].","thi-ap27:4.1":"“Sāvakaṃ dhutavādānaṃ, aggaṃ kittesi nāyako;","thi-ap27:4.3":"Sutvā sattāhikaṃ dānaṃ, datvā buddhassa tādino.","thi-ap27:5.1":"“Nipacca sirasā pāde, taṃ ṭhānamabhipatthayiṃ;","thi-ap27:5.3":"Sa hāsayanto parisaṃ, tadā hi narapuṅgavo.","thi-ap27:6.1":"“Seṭṭhino anukampāya, imā gāthā abhāsatha;","thi-ap27:6.3":"‘Lacchase patthitaṃ ṭhānaṃ, nibbuto hohi puttaka.","thi-ap27:7.1":"“‘Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","thi-ap27:7.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","thi-ap27:8.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādo, oraso dhammanimmito;","thi-ap27:8.3":"Kassapo nāma gottena, hessati satthu sāvako’.","thi-ap27:9.1":"“Taṃ sutvā mudito hutvā, yāvajīvaṃ tadā jinaṃ;","thi-ap27:9.3":"Mettacitto paricari, paccayehi vināyakaṃ.","thi-ap27:10.1":"“Sāsanaṃ jotayitvāna, so madditvā kutitthiye;","thi-ap27:10.3":"Veneyyaṃ vinayitvā ca, nibbuto so sasāvako.","thi-ap27:11.1":"“Nibbute tamhi lokagge, pūjanatthāya satthuno;","thi-ap27:11.3":"Ñātimitte samānetvā, saha tehi akārayi.","thi-ap27:12.1":"“Sattayojanikaṃ thūpaṃ, ubbiddhaṃ ratanāmayaṃ;","thi-ap27:12.3":"Jalantaṃ sataraṃsiṃva, sālarājaṃva phullitaṃ.","thi-ap27:13.1":"“Sattasatasahassāni, pātiyo [cātiyo (syā.)] tattha kārayi;","thi-ap27:13.3":"Naḷaggī viya jotantī [jotante (syā. pī.)], rataneheva sattahi.","thi-ap27:14.1":"“Gandhatelena pūretvā, dīpānujjalayī tahiṃ;","thi-ap27:14.3":"Pūjanatthāya [pūjatthāya (sī. ka.)] mahesissa, sabbabhūtānukampino.","thi-ap27:15.1":"“Sattasatasahassāni, puṇṇakumbhāni kārayi;","thi-ap27:15.3":"Rataneheva puṇṇāni, pūjanatthāya mahesino.","thi-ap27:16.1":"“Majjhe aṭṭhaṭṭhakumbhīnaṃ, ussitā kañcanagghiyo;","thi-ap27:16.3":"Atirocanti vaṇṇena, saradeva divākaro.","thi-ap27:17.1":"“Catudvāresu sobhanti, toraṇā ratanāmayā;","thi-ap27:17.3":"Ussitā phalakā rammā, sobhanti ratanāmayā.","thi-ap27:18.1":"“Virocanti parikkhittā [parikkhāyo (syā.)], avaṭaṃsā sunimmitā;","thi-ap27:18.3":"Ussitāni paṭākāni, ratanāni virocare.","thi-ap27:19.1":"“Surattaṃ sukataṃ cittaṃ, cetiyaṃ ratanāmayaṃ;","thi-ap27:19.3":"Atirocati vaṇṇena, sasañjhova [sasajjhāva (syā. ka.), sasañjāva (pī.)] divākaro.","thi-ap27:20.1":"“Thūpassa vediyo tisso, haritālena pūrayi;","thi-ap27:20.3":"Ekaṃ manosilāyekaṃ, añjanena ca ekikaṃ.","thi-ap27:21.1":"“Pūjaṃ etādisaṃ rammaṃ, kāretvā varavādino;","thi-ap27:21.3":"Adāsi dānaṃ saṅghassa, yāvajīvaṃ yathābalaṃ.","thi-ap27:22.1":"“Sahāva seṭṭhinā tena, tāni puññāni sabbaso;","thi-ap27:22.3":"Yāvajīvaṃ karitvāna, sahāva sugatiṃ gatā.","thi-ap27:23.1":"“Sampattiyonubhotvāna, devatte atha mānuse;","thi-ap27:23.3":"Chāyā viya sarīrena, saha teneva saṃsariṃ.","thi-ap27:24.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, vipassī nāma nāyako;","thi-ap27:24.3":"Uppajji cārudassano, sabbadhammavipassako.","thi-ap27:25.1":"“Tadāyaṃ bandhumatiyaṃ, brāhmaṇo sādhusammato;","thi-ap27:25.3":"Aḍḍho santo guṇenāpi [satthāgamenāsi (sī.)], dhanena ca suduggato.","thi-ap27:26.1":"“Tadāpi tassāhaṃ āsiṃ, brāhmaṇī samacetasā;","thi-ap27:26.3":"Kadāci so dijavaro, saṅgamesi mahāmuniṃ.","thi-ap27:27.1":"“Nisinnaṃ janakāyamhi, desentaṃ amataṃ padaṃ;","thi-ap27:27.3":"Sutvā dhammaṃ pamudito, adāsi ekasāṭakaṃ.","thi-ap27:28.1":"“Gharamekena vatthena, gantvānetaṃ sa mabravi [mamabravi (sī. syā. pī.)];","thi-ap27:28.3":"‘Anumoda mahāpuññaṃ [mahāpaññe (sī.), mahāpuññe (syā. ka.)], dinnaṃ buddhassa sāṭakaṃ’.","thi-ap27:29.1":"“Tadāhaṃ añjaliṃ katvā, anumodiṃ supīṇitā [suviditā (syā.), supītiyā (ka.)];","thi-ap27:29.3":"‘Sudinno sāṭako sāmi, buddhaseṭṭhassa tādino’.","thi-ap27:30.1":"“Sukhito sajjito hutvā, saṃsaranto bhavābhave;","thi-ap27:30.3":"Bārāṇasipure ramme, rājā āsi mahīpati.","thi-ap27:31.1":"“Tadā tassa mahesīhaṃ, itthigumbassa uttamā;","thi-ap27:31.3":"Tassāti dayitā [tassāvi dutiyikā (syā.)] āsiṃ, pubbasnehena bhattuno [cuttari (syā. pī. ka.)].","thi-ap27:32.1":"“Piṇḍāya vicarante te [so (sī. syā. pī.)], aṭṭha paccekanāyake;","thi-ap27:32.3":"Disvā pamudito hutvā, datvā piṇḍaṃ mahārahaṃ.","thi-ap27:33.1":"“Puno nimantayitvāna, katvā ratanamaṇḍapaṃ;","thi-ap27:33.3":"Kammārehi kataṃ pattaṃ [kataṃ chattaṃ (sī.), katamaṭṭhaṃ (syā.)], sovaṇṇaṃ vata tattakaṃ.","thi-ap27:34.1":"“Samānetvāna te sabbe, tesaṃ dānamadāsi so;","thi-ap27:34.3":"Soṇṇāsane paviṭṭhānaṃ, pasanno sehi pāṇibhi.","thi-ap27:35.1":"“Tampi dānaṃ sahādāsiṃ, kāsirājenahaṃ tadā;","thi-ap27:35.3":"Punāhaṃ bārāṇasiyaṃ, jātā kāsikagāmake.","thi-ap27:36.1":"“Kuṭumbikakule phīte, sukhito so sabhātuko;","thi-ap27:36.3":"Jeṭṭhassa bhātuno jāyā, ahosiṃ supatibbatā.","thi-ap27:37.1":"“Paccekabuddhaṃ disvāna, kaniyassa mama bhattuno [bhattukaniyaso (syā.)];","thi-ap27:37.3":"Bhāgannaṃ tassa datvāna, āgate tamhi pāvadiṃ.","thi-ap27:38.1":"“Nābhinandittha so dānaṃ, tato tassa adāsahaṃ;","thi-ap27:38.3":"Ukhā [buddhā (syā.)] āniya taṃ annaṃ, puno tasseva so adā.","thi-ap27:39.1":"“Tadannaṃ chaḍḍayitvāna, duṭṭhā buddhassahaṃ tadā;","thi-ap27:39.3":"Pattaṃ kalalapuṇṇaṃ taṃ, adāsiṃ tassa tādino.","thi-ap27:40.1":"“Dāne ca gahaṇe ceva, apace padusepi ca;","thi-ap27:40.3":"Samacittamukhaṃ disvā, tadāhaṃ saṃvijiṃ bhusaṃ.","thi-ap27:41.1":"“Puno pattaṃ gahetvāna, sodhayitvā sugandhinā;","thi-ap27:41.3":"Pasannacittā pūretvā, saghataṃ sakkaraṃ adaṃ.","thi-ap27:42.1":"“Yattha yatthūpapajjāmi, surūpā homi dānato;","thi-ap27:42.3":"Buddhassa apakārena, duggandhā vadanena ca.","thi-ap27:43.1":"“Puna kassapavīrassa, nidhāyantamhi cetiye;","thi-ap27:43.3":"Sovaṇṇaṃ iṭṭhakaṃ varaṃ, adāsiṃ muditā ahaṃ.","thi-ap27:44.1":"“Catujjātena gandhena, nicayitvā tamiṭṭhakaṃ;","thi-ap27:44.3":"Muttā duggandhadosamhā, sabbaṅgasusamāgatā.","thi-ap27:45.1":"“Sattapātisahassāni, rataneheva sattahi;","thi-ap27:45.3":"Kāretvā ghatapūrāni, vaṭṭīni [vaṭṭīyo (sī.)] ca sahassaso.","thi-ap27:46.1":"“Pakkhipitvā padīpetvā, ṭhapayiṃ sattapantiyo;","thi-ap27:46.3":"Pūjanatthaṃ lokanāthassa, vippasannena cetasā.","thi-ap27:47.1":"“Tadāpi tamhi puññamhi, bhāginīyi visesato;","thi-ap27:47.3":"Puna kāsīsu sañjāto, sumittā iti vissuto.","thi-ap27:48.1":"“Tassāhaṃ bhariyā āsiṃ, sukhitā sajjitā piyā;","thi-ap27:48.3":"Tadā paccekamunino, adāsiṃ ghanaveṭhanaṃ.","thi-ap27:49.1":"“Tassāpi bhāginī āsiṃ, moditvā dānamuttamaṃ;","thi-ap27:49.3":"Punāpi kāsiraṭṭhamhi, jāto koliyajātiyā.","thi-ap27:50.1":"“Tadā koliyaputtānaṃ, satehi saha pañcahi;","thi-ap27:50.3":"Pañcapaccekabuddhānaṃ, satāni samupaṭṭhahi.","thi-ap27:51.1":"“Temāsaṃ tappayitvāna [vāsayitvāna (syā. pī.)], adāsi ca ticīvare [ticīvaraṃ (syā.)];","thi-ap27:51.3":"Jāyā tassa tadā āsiṃ, puññakammapathānugā.","thi-ap27:52.1":"“Tato cuto ahu rājā, nando nāma mahāyaso;","thi-ap27:52.3":"Tassāpi mahesī āsiṃ, sabbakāmasamiddhinī.","thi-ap27:53.1":"“Tadā rājā bhavitvāna, brahmadatto mahīpati;","thi-ap27:53.3":"Padumavatīputtānaṃ, paccekamuninaṃ tadā.","thi-ap27:54.1":"“Satāni pañcanūnāni, yāvajīvaṃ upaṭṭhahiṃ;","thi-ap27:54.3":"Rājuyyāne nivāsetvā, nibbutāni ca pūjayiṃ.","thi-ap27:55.1":"“Cetiyāni ca kāretvā, pabbajitvā ubho mayaṃ;","thi-ap27:55.3":"Bhāvetvā appamaññāyo, brahmalokaṃ agamhase.","thi-ap27:56.1":"“Tato cuto mahātitthe, sujāto pipphalāyano;","thi-ap27:56.3":"Mātā sumanadevīti, kosigotto dijo pitā.","thi-ap27:57.1":"“Ahaṃ madde janapade, sākalāya puruttame;","thi-ap27:57.3":"Kappilassa dijassāsiṃ, dhītā mātā sucīmati.","thi-ap27:58.1":"“Ghanakañcanabimbena, nimminitvāna maṃ pitā;","thi-ap27:58.3":"Adā kassapadhīrassa, kāmehi vajjitassamaṃ.","thi-ap27:59.1":"“Kadāci so kāruṇiko, gantvā kammantapekkhako;","thi-ap27:59.3":"Kākādikehi khajjante, pāṇe disvāna saṃviji.","thi-ap27:60.1":"“Gharevāhaṃ tile jāte, disvānātapatāpane;","thi-ap27:60.3":"Kimi kākehi khajjante, saṃvegamalabhiṃ tadā.","thi-ap27:61.1":"“Tadā so pabbajī dhīro, ahaṃ tamanupabbajiṃ;","thi-ap27:61.3":"Pañcavassāni nivasiṃ, paribbājavate [paribbājapathe (syā. pī.)] ahaṃ.","thi-ap27:62.1":"“Yadā pabbajitā āsi, gotamī jinaposikā;","thi-ap27:62.3":"Tadāhaṃ tamupagantvā, buddhena anusāsitā.","thi-ap27:63.1":"“Na cireneva kālena, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ;","thi-ap27:63.3":"Aho kalyāṇamittattaṃ, kassapassa sirīmato.","thi-ap27:64.1":"“Suto buddhassa dāyādo, kassapo susamāhito;","thi-ap27:64.3":"Pubbenivāsaṃ yo vedi, saggāpāyañca passati.","thi-ap27:65.1":"“Atho jātikkhayaṃ patto, abhiññāvosito muni;","thi-ap27:65.3":"Etāhi tīhi vijjāhi, tevijjo hoti brāhmaṇo.","thi-ap27:66.1":"“Tatheva bhaddakāpilānī [bhaddākāpilānī (sī. pī.)], tevijjā maccuhāyinī;","thi-ap27:66.3":"Dhāreti antimaṃ dehaṃ, jitvā māraṃ savāhanaṃ.","thi-ap27:67.1":"“Disvā ādīnavaṃ loke, ubho pabbajitā mayaṃ;","thi-ap27:67.3":"Tyamha khīṇāsavā dantā, sītibhūtāmha nibbutā.","thi-ap27:68.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap27:69.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap27:70.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap27:71.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ bhaddakāpilānī bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap27:72.1":"Bhaddakāpilānītheriyāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
